<title>USA: Calgon Carbon might resume stock buy back.</title>
<headline>Calgon Carbon might resume stock buy back.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calgon Carbon Corp said Tuesday it might buy back more of its stock from time to time pursuant to its repurchase program.</p>
<p>Calgon said it had already bought about 1.0 million shares under the program, which allows it to repurchase up to a total of 2.0 million.</p>
</text>
